79 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(NAFAS BAJAKIMIA Sdn. Bhd. is a subsidiary company fully owned by National Farmers Organization \(NAFAS\) and one of the main fertilizer suppliers which contribute to the country\220s economy especially in agriculture industry. NAFAS Bajakimia Sdn. Bhd. is a leading company specializing in the import, transportation, warehousing, and distribution of single and compound fertilizers to farmers across Malaysia, particularly in the rice cultivation and palm oil sectors. The company\220s fertilizer supply operations support the aspirations of the National Food Security Policy \(DSMN\) by ensuring that fertilizers are efficiently imported, manufactured, stored, transported, and distributed to the agricultural and plantation industries nationwide. NAFAS Bajakimia\220s warehousing and fertilizer handling activities are managed in compliance with BS EN ISO 9001:2015, demonstrating its strong commitment to quality management, safety, and operational excellence. In addition, NAFAS Bajakimia Sdn. Bhd. actively promotes fertilizers in the open market. Among its marketed products is the MPOB F3 Palm Fertilizer, formulated with Zeolite to enhance soil fertility and increase palm yields. This fertilizer is also suitable for use across various other crop types. With extensive experience since 1974, the company has established itself as a trusted and leading provider in the supply of both single and compound fertilizers, catering to open market demands and major plantation tenders. The company\220s mission is to deliver high-quality fertilizers under the Peladang brand, maintaining its position as Malaysia\220s reliable fertilizer partner while contributing significantly to the nation\220s agricultural development and economic growth.)/E(NAFAS BAJAKIMIA Sdn. Bhd. is a subsidiary company fully owned by National Farmers Organization \(NAFAS\) and one of the main fertilizer suppliers which contribute to the country\220s economy especially in agriculture industry. NAFAS Bajakimia Sdn. Bhd. is a leading company specializing in the import, transportation, warehousing, and distribution of single and compound fertilizers to farmers across Malaysia, particularly in the rice cultivation and palm oil sectors. The company\220s fertilizer supply operations support the aspirations of the National Food Security Policy \(DSMN\) by ensuring that fertilizers are efficiently imported, manufactured, stored, transported, and distributed to the agricultural and plantation industries nationwide. NAFAS Bajakimia\220s warehousing and fertilizer handling activities are managed in compliance with BS EN ISO 9001:2015, demonstrating its strong commitment to quality management, safety, and operational excellence. In addition, NAFAS Bajakimia Sdn. Bhd. actively promotes fertilizers in the open market. Among its marketed products is the MPOB F3 Palm Fertilizer, formulated with Zeolite to enhance soil fertility and increase palm yields. This fertilizer is also suitable for use across various other crop types. With extensive experience since 1974, the company has established itself as a trusted and leading provider in the supply of both single and compound fertilizers, catering to open market demands and major plantation tenders. The company\220s mission is to deliver high-quality fertilizers under the Peladang brand, maintaining its position as Malaysia\220s reliable fertilizer partner while contributing significantly to the nation\220s agricultural development and economic growth.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[0 1]>>
endobj

